WEBVTT - M&J Water Wells Drilling Story Captions

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Every project starts on open ground.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Our rig arrives on site.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Our manager walks the site first.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
We check access, ground, and setbacks.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.500
The rig is set and level.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:35.000
We drill through every layer.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Water collects at its natural level.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Clean water found.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:50.600
Clean water, delivered to your home.
